   "body_md": "## What listeners single out\n\n- **Roll On Buddy** (1 review): Roll On Buddy is reached by segue from Home Of The Red Fox [2]\n- **China Doll** (1 review): China Doll flows directly into Midnight Rider, with no break between them [2]\n- **I Only Exist** (1 review): I Only Exist opens the encore, and This Heart Of Mine follows it [2]\n\n## Setlist highlights\n\n- **Ain't Got No Honey Baby Now**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [3]\n- **Doc Watson Instrumental**: rare: 4 archived performances [3]\n- **Pyramid County**: rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n- **Muddy Water Take My Pain Away**: rare: 9 archived performances [3]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **bs2017-09-28** (recommended): source not stated; 14 songs; 77 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **bs2017-09-28**: taped by Adam; source: Busman BSC1(k3)>Bumblebees>Oade Mod PMD661 [1]\n\n## Art and photos\n\n- Poster by @BillybaseDotNet: [Billy Strings Woodlands Tavern - Columbus, OH - BillyBase](https://billybase.net/show/woodlands-tavern-columbus-oh-3/) [4]",
